{"ts":"2026-07-25T02:02:06.258Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-25T02:02:06.258Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-25T02:02:06.258Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Evidence: implemented public SDK runtime primitives for deterministic author resolution and harness detection (Codex, Claude Code, pi, OpenCode, Cursor, Aider, Gemini, CI), explicit/env/configured/harness precedence, provenance propagation through history, and portable source-workspace roots for sandboxed linked tests. Verified by the full 6,290-test coverage run at 100/100/100/100 and an anonymous packed-package consumer where PM_AUTHOR was unset and mutations recorded harness:codex."}]}],"before_hash":"8c747c584558acbe70cab2e616ff9794a56055039177356ba98e81a71342af2b","after_hash":"3b5f206ae6ef85851081c26864a2da6e8018d430596f6c2b3558227a8abadd2b"}
{"ts":"2026-07-25T02:02:06.888Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","op":"learning_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-25T02:02:06.888Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/learnings","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-25T02:02:06.885Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Agent identity belongs in a deterministic SDK primitive: explicit, environment, configured, detected harness, then unknown. Harness detection must inspect bounded process metadata only and must never require a user-authored environment variable."}]}],"before_hash":"3b5f206ae6ef85851081c26864a2da6e8018d430596f6c2b3558227a8abadd2b","after_hash":"b85d3ec238df713bf9516ffd5b3cfe6510c117081a159c1bd4337104e1472f4a"}
